sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant H as Hub / mock
    participant S as Solver
    participant V as Source
    participant D as DepositAccount
    H->>S: Order and deadline
    Note over S: FUTURE pre-bid policy
    S->>V: Quote
    S->>H: Signed bid
    H->>S: Assignment
    S->>H: Signed acceptance
    C->>D: Deposit
    D-->>S: Net tokens
    H->>S: Receipt reference
    Note over S: Verify receipt
    S->>H: Deposit ack
